---js
{
	title: 'Concerts',
	summary: 'I haven’t been to a lot of gigs, but I still think it’s worth sharing!',
	ogImageSummary: 'Live music archiving efforts',
	permalink: '/music/concerts/',
	section: 'music',
	tags: ['_og'],
	events: [
		{
			date: '2006-03-04',
			city: 'London, England, United Kingdom',
			venue: 'Dominion Theatre',
			main: 'We Will Rock You',
			seat: { section: 'Circle', row: 'D', seat: 19 },
			type: 'musical',
			stub: 'stub-2006-03-04-wwry.avif',
			stubSize: [424, 197],
			stubHue: 166,
			commentary: 'While this was a musical, I still consider this to be my first concert. I was with my family, we got (probably overcharged) mini Häagen-Dazs tubs and I spilled it on myself. Good memories!',
		},
		{
			date: '2006-07-17',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Théâtres Romains de Fouvière',
			main: 'Les Nuits de Fouvière',
			sub: 'The Strokes',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2006-07-17-strokes.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 193,
			commentary: 'My brother took me to this concert, and I had a great time, the venue is absolutely gorgeous. Not so keen on The Strokes these days, but First Impressions of Earth was one hell of a record.',
		},
		{
			date: '2006-12-11',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Halle Tony Garnier',
			main: 'Muse',
			sub: '+ Noisettes',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2006-12-11-muse.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 76,
			commentary: 'My brother, being a huge Muse fan, brought me along for the ride (on my birthday no less!), and I had a great time, despite the slight difficulty navigating the “mosh pit” for my 13-year-old self.',
		},
		{
			date: '2008-09-04',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Halle Tony Garnier',
			main: 'Coldplay',
			sub: ['Viva la Vida Tour', '+ Albert Hammond Jr'],
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2008-09-04-coldplay.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 349,
			commentary: 'I remember having a pretty good time, despite not being the biggest Coldplay fan.',
		},
		{
			date: '2008-12-03',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Le Marché Gare',
			main: 'Funeral for a Friend',
			sub: '+ Cancer Bats',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2008-12-03-ffaf.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 349,
			commentary: 'My brother, big fan, took me to see them, and then he chatted with the singer at the merch booth for a while I was just standing there — happy he got to do that, despite the awkwardness for me!',
		},
		{
			date: '2009-10-26',
			city: 'Copenhagen, Denmark',
			venue: 'Parken',
			main: 'Muse',
			sub: 'The Resistance Tour',
			seat: { section: 'Lower A9', row: 24, seat: 175 },
			stub: 'stub-2009-10-26-muse.avif',
			stubSize: [622, 287],
			stubHue: 183,
			commentary: 'My brother could not get enough of Muse, so while visiting my dad in Denmark, we, of course, went to see them.',
		},
		{
			date: '2009-12-22',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Halle Tony Garnier',
			main: 'Muse',
			sub: ['The Resistance Tour', '+ Biffy Clyro'],
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2009-11-22-muse.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 349,
			commentary: 'And back at home… yep, you guess it, more Muse. But also got to see Biffy Clyro!',
		},
		{
			date: '2010-10-10',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Transbordeur',
			main: 'Pendulum',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2010-10-10-pendulum.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 319],
			stubHue: 349,
			commentary: 'I don’t recommend being at the front row of any gig, but it was worth it here, I had a blast! (also the date in short ISO is 10-10-10, which is 42 in binary, which is random but cool)',
		},
		{
			date: '2011-11-20',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Transbordeur',
			main: 'Thirty Seconds to Mars',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2011-11-20-30stm.avif',
			stubSize: [584, 320],
			stubHue: 5,
			commentary: 'Well with what I know now, I certainly don’t hold any dear memories of this. I do remember them saying something like “This is our favourite venue yet!” — sure thing bud, I’m convinced you didn’t say that at every single show…',
		},
		{
			date: '2012-03-17',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Transbordeur',
			main: 'Rumble Festival 2012 - Day 2',
			sub: 'Noisia',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2012-03-17-noisia.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 321],
			stubHue: 298,
			commentary: 'Calling this a festival is generous, but it was fun to see Noisia with some friends.',
		},
		{
			date: '2012-05-25',
			city: 'Lyon, France',
			venue: 'Halle Tony Garnier',
			main: 'Justice',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2012-05-25-justice.avif',
			stubSize: [522, 321],
			stubHue: 298,
			commentary: 'Great show but this is where I got my ears damaged and I’ve had tinnitus since… it’s faint but constant. Always wear earplugs, kids! As a result it’s a bittersweet event…',
		},
		{
			date: '2012-06-25',
			city: 'Paris, France',
			venue: 'L’Olympia',
			main: 'deadmau5',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2012-06-25-deadmau5.avif',
			stubSize: [516, 321],
			stubHue: 298,
			commentary: 'I built a “creepermau5” head for this, made of papier mâché, taking it with me in the train for 2 hours to get to Paris. It was loads of fun, and thanksfully I could be in the front row so I could "lower" the head past the guardrail and not spoil the show for the people behind me. Joel Zimmerman (deadmau5) gave me some finger guns when he saw my creation, so that was cool.',
		},
		{
			date: '2014-03-08',
			city: 'Paris, France',
			venue: 'Le Palais des Congrès de Paris',
			main: 'Distant Worlds: Final Fantasy',
			seat: { section: 2, row: 'X', seat: 26 },
			stub: 'stub-2014-03-08-ffdw.avif',
			stubSize: [592, 245],
			stubHue: 28,
			commentary: 'A wonderful evening with friends enjoying a Final Fantasy orchestral concert, couldn’t ask for more.',
			type: 'orchestra',
		},
		{
			date: '2015-08-25',
			city: 'London, England, United Kingdom',
			venue: 'O2 Forum Kentish Town',
			main: 'Thrice',
			sub: '+ Milk Teeth / Greywind',
			seat: 'GA',
			stub: 'stub-2016-08-25-thrice.avif',
			stubSize: [546, 292],
			stubHue: 38,
			commentary: 'My brother took me to see Thrice (my favourite band!) while I went to visit him. Good times.',
		},
		{
			date: '2017-04-01',
			city: 'New York City, NY, USA',
			venue: 'Hammerstein Ballroom',
			main: 'deadmau5',
			sub: '+ Feed Me',
			seat: { section: 'BALC1', row: 'GA7', seat: 13 },
			commentary: 'One fun thing I remember about this show is a guy next to me seeing the bracelet (denoting I could buy alcohol) and saying “let me know if you want me to buy you some booze”. Had to politely explain “thanks but I can do that on my own”!',
		},
		{
			date: '2017-05-03',
			city: 'New York City, NY, USA',
			venue: 'Brooklyn Steel',
			main: 'Tycho',
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'Very good show, this one! Gutted I didn’t go to the following day’s show, as Khruangbin was opening!'
		},
		{
			date: '2018-05-23',
			city: 'New York City, NY, USA',
			venue: 'Brooklyn Steel',
			main: 'The Kooks',
			sub: '+ The Academic',
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'This was a pretty fun concert, though I do not really listen to The Kooks a lot.'
		},
		{
			date: '2018-10-05',
			city: 'New York City, NY, USA',
			venue: 'PlayStation Theater',
			main: 'Thrice',
			sub: '+ The Bronx / Teenage Wrist',
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'I have zero recollection of this venue but it’s Thrice so I recall having a good time.'
		},
		{
			date: '2020-02-08',
			city: 'New York City, NY, USA',
			venue: 'Brooklyn Steel',
			main: 'Thrice',
			sub: ['Vheissu 15<sup>th</sup> anniversary','+ mewithoutYou / Drug Church / Holy Fawn'],
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'One more Thrice concert, celebrating Vheissu’s 15th anniversary, right before lockdown…',
		},
		{
			date: '2022-11-29',
			city: 'Cincinnati, OH, USA',
			venue: 'Bogart’s',
			main: 'Bad Omens',
			sub: '+ Dayseeker / Make Them Suffer',
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'This was my fastest “discover band” to “get concert tickets” pipeline to date. I had barely heard of Bad Omens 6 months prior but got obsessed with their songs, especially Like A Villain, so I had to check them out. Fun fact: this is where I first got COVID-19, after nearly 3 years of avoiding it! Masking was not enough…'
		},
		{
			date: '2023-03-01',
			city: 'Cincinnati, OH, USA',
			venue: 'Bogart’s',
			main: 'Bayside',
			sub: '+ I Am the Avalanche / Koyo',
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'Good times, and I did not catch COVID again so, a win in my book.'
		},
		{
			date: '2023-07-15',
			city: 'Cincinnati, OH, USA',
			venue: 'Riverbend Music Center',
			main: 'Fall Out Boy',
			sub: ['So Much For (Tour) Dust', '+ Bring Me The Horizon / CARR / Royal &amp; the Serpent'],
			seat: 'GA',
			commentary: 'I admit I mostly went to see Bring Me The Horizon, but I had fun, although it rained for like 30 minutes during the BMTH set… the mud in the parking lot was fun afterwards.'
		},
	],
}
---

<div class="legendary | hide-when-nojs">
	<div class="legendary-label | h3">Content customisation</div>
	<div class="legendary-content | flow | fontSize-smaller" data-flow-space="s">
		<p>
			I collected my ticket stubs, before they went all-digital, but time was not kind to every one of them.
			You can see the scanned version instead of plaintext with the toggle below.
		</p>

		{{ component 'cta', {
			icon: 'printer',
			iconClass: 'button-icon',
			iconBefore: true,
			label: {
				aria: 'Toggle original scans of the ticket stubs',
				text: `Stub scans:
				<span class="cellstack cellstack--inline | fontFamily-monospace">
					<span class="button-content--idle">OFF</span>
					<span class="button-content--pressed">ON</span>
				</span>`
			},
			safeLabel: true,
			ctaType: 'button',
			ctaClass: 'linecap-auto',
			ctaAttr: 'data-persist-pressed-style data-toggle-pressed aria-pressed="false" id="plaintext-stubs"',
		} }}
	</div>
</div>

<ol class="event-list">
{{ for i, event of events.sort((a,b) => b.date.localeCompare(a.date)) }}
	<li class="event-item" style="--i: {{ i+1 }};{{ if event.stubHue }} --h: {{ event.stubHue }};{{ /if }}" aria-labelledby="concert-label-{{ i+1 }}">	
		<div class="event-ticket-container">
			<h2 id="concert-label-{{ i+1 }}" class="visually-hidden">{{ event.main }}</h2>

			{{ set stubImage = null }}
			{{ set eventNiceDate = event.date |> dateFormat({ format: 'nice' }) }}
			{{ if event.stub }}{{ set stubImage = [assets.images, 'concert-stubs', event.stub] |> toPath }}{{ /if }}
			{{ if stubImage }}<img src="{{ stubImage }}" alt="" width="{{ event.stubSize[0] }}" height="{{ event.stubSize[1] }}" class="event-ticket event-ticket--scan"{{ if i >= 4 }} loading="lazy"{{ /if }}>{{ /if }}
			<div class="event-ticket event-ticket--plaintext">
				<div class="event-ticket-center">
					<p class="event-ticket-location">
						<span class="event-ticket-venue">{{ event.venue }}</span>
						<br>
						<span class="event-ticket-city">{{ event.city }}</span>
					</p>
					
					<p class="event-ticket-main" aria-hidden="true">{{ event.main }}</p>
					
					{{ if event.sub }}
						{{> event.sub = typeof event.sub === 'string' ? [event.sub] : event.sub; }}
						{{ for s, sub of event.sub }}<p class="event-ticket-sub" style="--s: {{ s+1 }};">{{ sub }}</p>{{ /for }}
					{{ /if }}

					<div class="event-ticket-info">
						<time datetime="{{ event.date }}T12:00:00" class="event-ticket-date">
							{{ new Date(`${event.date}T12:00:00`).toLocaleString(metadata.lang, { weekday: 'long' }) }} {{ eventNiceDate }}
						</time>
						{{ if event.commentary }}
							<button type="button" command="show-modal" commandfor="concert-info-{{ i+1 }}" class="reset-button event-info-button linecap-auto">
								{{ svg 'info', { class: 'button-icon' } }}
								<span class="visually-hidden">Notes for {{ eventNiceDate }} event</span>
							</button>
						{{ /if }}
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="event-ticket-side">
					<dl class="event-ticket-seating">
						<div class="event-ticket-section">
							<dt>Section</dt>
							<dd>{{ typeof event.seat === 'object' ? event.seat.section : (event.seat === 'GA' ? 'GenAdm' : event.seat) }}</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="event-ticket-row">
							<dt>Row</dt>
							<dd{{ if typeof event.seat !== 'object' }} class="visually-hidden"{{ /if }}>{{ typeof event.seat === 'object' ? event.seat.row : 'N/A' }}</dd>
						</div>
						<div class="event-ticket-seat">
							<dt>Seat</dt>
							<dd{{ if typeof event.seat !== 'object' }} class="visually-hidden"{{ /if }}>{{ typeof event.seat === 'object' ? event.seat.seat : 'N/A' }}</dd>
						</div>
					</dl>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		{{ if event.commentary }}
		<dialog class="event-info-dialog" id="concert-info-{{ i+1 }}">
			<div class="dialog-inner flow" style="--flow-space: var(--size-s);">
				<div class="grouper grouper--toolbar">
					<h2>{{ event.main }} / {{ event.date }}</h2>

					<button type="button" commandfor="concert-info-{{ i+1 }}" command="close" class="button button--icon-only">
						{{ svg 'close', { width: 24, height: 24 } }}
						<span class="visually-hidden">Close</span>
					</button>
				</div>

				<p>{{ event.commentary }}</p>
			</div>
		</dialog>
		{{ /if }}
	</li>
{{ /for }}
</ol>

<hr>

<p>A couple of notes:</p>
<ul>
	<li>I don’t have all the info for the guests at every show, unfortunately.</li>
	<li>At this point in time, I’ve seen my favourite band, Thrice, thrice.</li>
	<li>100% inspired by <a href="https://concerts.lynnandtonic.com/">Lynn Fisher’s Concert Archive</a>.</li>
</ul>

<style>
	.event-list {
		display: grid;
		gap: var(--size-l);
		
		list-style-type: '';
	}

	.event-item {
		--hue: calc(var(--h, mod(5 * var(--i), 7) * 42) * 1deg);

		position: sticky;
		inset-block-start: var(--size-xl);
	}

	.event-ticket-container {
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		margin-inline: auto;
		inline-size: 100%;
		max-inline-size: 36rem;

		transform-style: preserve-3d;
		transition: transform var(--anim-short) var(--easing-in-out);
	}

	.event-ticket-container > * {
		grid-area: 1 / 1 / -1 / -1;
	}

	.event-ticket {
		align-self: center;

		backface-visibility: hidden;
		rotate: calc(sign(mod(var(--i), 2) - 0.5) * mod(5 * var(--i), 7) * 0.5deg * var(--a, 1));
		
		filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 4px #0008);
	}

	.event-ticket--plaintext {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
		inline-size: 100%;
		padding: 1em;

		font-family: Courier, var(--fontStack-monospace);
		color: #000000;
		border-inline: 2px dashed #0008;
		background: oklch(95% 10% var(--hue));
	}

	.event-ticket--scan {
		zoom: 1.2;
		transform: rotateY(180deg);
	}

	.event-list--show-scans .event-ticket-container:has(.event-ticket--scan) {
		transform: rotateY(180deg);
	}

	.event-ticket-center {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.5em;
		padding: 1em;

		text-align: center;
		background:
			linear-gradient(to top left, oklch(95% 10% var(--hue) / 0.5), #0000),
			radial-gradient(100% 100% at 100% 100%, #0000 98%, oklch(98% 10% var(--hue)) 100%, #0000),
			radial-gradient(100% 100% at 0% 120%, #0000 98%, oklch(98% 10% var(--hue)) 100%, #0000);
		background-color: #fff;
	}
	.event-ticket-venue {
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.event-ticket-location,
	.event-ticket-main {
		line-height: 1.1;
	}

	.event-ticket-location {
		margin-block-end: auto;
	}

	.event-ticket-city {
		font-size: 0.875em;
	}

	.event-ticket-main,
	.event-ticket-sub {
		align-self: center;
	}

	.event-ticket-main {
		font-size: 1.5em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.event-ticket-sub {
		font-size: calc((3 - var(--s)) * 0.67 * 0.875em);
		line-height: 1.25;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.event-ticket-date {
		align-self: end;
		margin-block-start: auto;
		padding: 0.125em 0.75em;

		font-size: 0.75em;
		font-weight: normal;
		text-align: center;
		color: #fff;
		background: #000;
	}
	.event-ticket-side {
		writing-mode: vertical-rl;
		text-orientation: sideways-right;
	}

	.event-ticket-seating {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		grid-template-rows: repeat(2, auto);
		gap: 0.25em 0.5em;

		list-style-type: '';
		font-size: 0.875em;
	}

	.event-ticket-section,
	.event-ticket-row,
	.event-ticket-seat {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: subgrid;
		
		text-align: left;
		text-align: start;
	}

	.event-ticket-info {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		align-items: flex-end;
		gap: var(--size-m);
	}

	.event-info-button {
		--_cta-icon-size: 1.33em;

		align-self: end;
		padding: 0.25em;

		font-size: var(--typeScale-n1);
		color: #fff;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 0;
		background: #000;
	}
	.event-info-button:is(:hover, :focus-visible) {
		background-color: oklch(10% 80% var(--hue));
		outline: 2px solid oklch(10% 80% var(--hue));
		outline-offset: 2px;
	}
</style>
<script>
	document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
		if (!e.target || !e.target.closest) { return; }
		let target;
		if ((target = e.target.closest('#plaintext-stubs'))) {
			document.querySelector('.event-list').classList.toggle('event-list--show-scans');
		} else if ((target = e.target.closest('[command][commandfor]'))) {
			if (!target.command) {
				// Older browser handling
				const command = target.getAttribute('command');
				const commandFor = document.getElementById(target.getAttribute('commandfor'));
				if (command === 'show-modal') {
					commandFor.showModal();
				} else if (command === 'close') {
					commandFor.close();
				}
			}
		} else if ((target = e.target.closest('dialog.event-info-dialog'))) {
			if (!e.target.closest('.dialog-inner')) {
				target.close(); // Close
			}
		}
	});
</script>